<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Court adjourns Advance merger hearing.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Court adjourns Advance merger hearing.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Supreme Court of New South Wales on Monday adjourned the hearing to approve the merger between Advance Bank Australia Ltd and St George Bank Ltd for the second time today.</p>
<p>The hearing is scheduled to resume at 2.05 p.m. (0305 GMT).</p>
</text>
